#: src/core-concepts/design-goals.md:3
msgid "rut is a small, statically typed, embeddable scripting language with Rust-flavored syntax, implemented in Rust. It is designed to be the scripting layer of host applications â UI apps in particular â in the role a JavaScript engine usually plays: a safe, hot-reloadable language that drives the host's object graph."
