#: src/core-concepts/design-goals.md:20
msgid "**Fully static, reified types.** There is no dynamic typing, no `any`, no gradual typing. Every value's exact type is known to the compiler and carried at runtime â type tests, checked erasure, and host-boundary checks all read the same runtime truth. See [reified types and layouts](reified-types.md)."
