#: src/core-concepts/design-goals.md:32
msgid "**Everything is a value â with two honest regimes.** Primitives move by value; every composite (`str`, `bytes`, records, arrays, trait objects, erasure boxes) is a reference-counted cell whose handle copies in O(1). Sharing is the default and visible; there is no hidden copying. See [everything is a value](everything-is-a-value.md)."
