#: src/core-concepts/design-goals.md:54
msgid "**Embeddable by contract.** The host registers native functions whose Rust signatures _are_ the declared surface; every crossing is type-checked against reified types, and the host owns the event loop, the fuel budget, and the clock. See [the host boundary](host-boundary.md) and [the bytecode VM](the-vm.md)."
