#: src/core-concepts/design-goals.md:87
msgid "**Too much memory.** JS values are boxes â per-object headers, tagged pointers, boxed array elements, collector overhead. rut's answer is layout: untagged 8-byte slots, record payloads as slot arrays, flat primitive buffers, and reference counting with no collector pass on the hot path."
