#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:148
msgid "```rut\nlet counts$ = store.derive(fn (ctx) -> str {\n    let items = ctx.get(items$);\n    let reqs = ctx.get(reqs$);\n    let mut open = 0;\n    for (let t of items) {\n        if (t.done == false) {\n            open += 1;\n        }\n    }\n    let done_n = items.len() - open;\n    return f\"{open} open | {done_n} done | {reqs.len()} in flight\";\n});\n```"
